{"parentUuid":"4e7ce70b-8abe-4ff3-8a33-17fa39537d77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01QLzMLrtMZydRAhbtBGtN3c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full list from `review-02.md`:\n\n## High (Must Fix)\n\n1. **Dispatch TUI ignores `ACCESSIBLE=1`** — screen-reader users get animated spinner + ANSI-painted markdown. `dispatch.go:84-98` routes on terminal detection only; no `IsAccessibleMode()` check. Wizard uses `NewAccessibleForm` correctly but the generation step afterward runs Bubble Tea (`dispatch_tui.go:62-91`) and Glamour (`dispatch_tui.go:93-108`). Compare `search_cmd.go:73` which short-circuits on accessible mode.\n\n2. **Wizard `currentBranch` resolver called on every keystroke in local mode** — `dispatch_wizard.go:311-325` wires both `DescriptionFunc`s to `state.resolve(currentBranch)`, which shells out to `git` each repaint. Also **breaks on detached HEAD**: `currentBranchName` returns `\"not on a branch (detached HEAD)\"` (`mode_local.go:315`), and the Resolved Options / Command notes both render as `Validation error: ...` with no way to progress.\n\n## Important (Should Fix)\n\n3. **`--local` help text says \"local LLM tokens\"** (`dispatch.go:70`) — misleading. Local mode still invokes the installed Claude Code CLI (`generate.go:22`), using the user's Claude account tokens. Suggest: *\"generate via the locally-installed agent CLI instead of the Entire server\"*.\n\n4. **N+1 `git log` in local checkpoint enumeration** (`mode_local.go:155-161`, `mode_local.go:199`) — `findCommitSubjectByCheckpoint` shells out `git log --all --grep=... --format=%s%x00` per checkpoint. O(N) traversals of all refs. Replace with a single `git log --grep='Entire-Checkpoint:' --format='%H%x00%s%x00%B' --since=... --all` and build a map once.\n\n5. **Bullet `Text` values not sanitized like voice** (`generate.go:188-192`) — `sanitizeDispatchVoice` strips control / bidi / zero-width chars from voice, but the identical sanitization is NOT applied to `metadata.Summary.Outcome` (`mode_local.go:192`) or commit subjects (`mode_local.go:199`). `json.Encode` with `SetEscapeHTML(false)` preserves raw bidi overrides / null bytes verbatim. Extract as `sanitizePromptString` and run bullet text through it.\n\n6. **Dispatch TUI duplicates patterns from `search_tui.go`** (`dispatch_tui.go:52-58`, `dispatch_tui.go:109-136`) — status-model lifecycle, ctx/cancel, spinner.Model, View() card composition, inline-clear helper all re-implemented. At minimum, `renderedLineCount` + the ANSI clear sequence `\"\\x1b[1A\\x1b[2K\\r\"` should live in a shared helper.\n\n7. **`--repos` values not validated as `owner/repo` slugs** (`options.go:19-22`) — `normalizeScopeValues` trims + dedupes but allows arbitrary strings (`\"../../etc\"`, `\"a b c\"`, newlines). Require `^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+$`.\n\n8. **`go loadRepos()` prefetch leaks work if user picks Local** (`dispatch_wizard.go:220-230`) — fires a `gh api --paginate user/repos` call before the user picks a mode. Discarded on Local. Wasteful against GitHub API rate limits. Gate the prefetch behind mode selection.\n\n9. **Non-401 cloud errors leak endpoint in user message** (`cloud.go:187-194`) — output is `\"POST /api/v1/dispatches/generate: unexpected status 500: \\\"body\\\"\"`. Diagnostic-grade noise. Log the method/path via `logging.Warn` and return a trimmed user-facing string (or use `SilentError` per CLAUDE.md).\n\n10. **`ReadCommitted` error silently swallowed with `continue`** (`mode_local.go:175-178`) — data-integrity signal worth at least `logging.Warn` with CheckpointID + err. Today user gets a smaller-than-expected dispatch with no indication that some checkpoints were dropped.\n\n## Suggestions (Consider)\n\n11. **`\"N month\"` is 30 days, not calendar months** (`flags.go:85-87`) — `\"2 months ago\"` = `60*24h`. Surprises users near month boundaries. Use `AddDate(0, -n, 0)` or drop month from the grammar.\n\n12. **`newDispatchProgram` takes `altScreen bool` but every caller passes `false`** (`dispatch_tui.go:52-58`) — dead parameter.\n\n13. **Sibling repo discovery walks symlinks implicitly** (`dispatch_wizard.go:400-438`) — `entry.IsDir()` reports true for symlinks pointing at directories; `os.Stat(.../.git)` follows symlinks. Low risk but use `os.Lstat` or document as intentional.\n\n14. **`resolveRepoFullName` requires origin with parseable GitHub URL** (`mode_local.go:293-307`) — fresh local init or non-GitHub remote (SourceHut, self-hosted Gitea) fails the whole dispatch. Consider falling back to directory name.\n\n15. **`dispatchTextGeneratorFactory` hardcodes Claude Code** (`generate.go:21-27`) — no way to use Cursor / OpenCode even though `TextGenerator` interface exists for all of them. Read preferred agent from settings or add `--agent` flag.\n\n16. **`newDispatchStatusModel` hard-codes card height 12 and `min(max(width-8, 44), 76)`** (`dispatch_tui.go:109-136`) — 40-col terminals clamp to 44 and overflow. Pass `ss.width` through and respect it.\n\n17. **Flag-hide panic pattern** (`dispatch.go:77-79`) — matches `login.go`/`trail_cmd.go` so consistency is fine, but `MarkHidden` can't realistically fail. Replace with `_ = cmd.Flags().MarkHidden(...)`.\n\n18. **No length cap on literal `--voice` string** (`voices.go:33-35`) — 10MB voice string would be embedded verbatim in every LLM prompt. Cap at ~1 KB.\n\n## Praise\n\n- **HTTPS enforcement**: `requireSecureDispatchURL = api.RequireSecureURL` with test-only seam (`mode_cloud.go:19`), dedicated `TestServerMode_RejectsPlainHTTPBaseURL` that explicitly doesn't stub the guard (`mode_cloud_test.go:380-398`), plus matching `--insecure-http-auth` test.\n- **Default-branch ancestry gate** (`mode_local.go:258-277`) with three complementary regression tests.\n- **`reachableCheckpointIDsInRange` git-shim test** (`mode_local_test.go:616-662`) — asserts only `git log` invocations are captured.\n- **Forward-compat JSON decoding** (`cloud_test.go:170-194`) + `APIBranches.UnmarshalJSON` accepting both `[\"x\",\"y\"]` and `\"all\"`.\n- **Thorough voice sanitization** (control chars, zero-width, bidi overrides) — just needs extending to bullet text.\n- **Clean mode separation** between cloud and local; no shared global state beyond test-only hooks.\n\nSummary: 2 High + 8 Important + 8 Suggestions + 6 Praise. Fix estimate: 4–6 hours for both Highs + top 3 Importants."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":60472,"output_tokens":2734,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2734,"cache_read_input_tokens":60472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaNEbsoVsbud88QB2AjW7","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5703957-da8e-44c7-9c60-626eaa87a01f","timestamp":"2026-04-24T07:54:44.571Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_worktree1","sessionId":"9f8807c3-8ca8-4e46-ade3-53510f000a6f","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-dispatch-codex"}
